  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\left|z_{1}\\right|=\\left|z_{2}\\right|=\\ldots \\ldots \\ldots . .\\left|z_{n}\\right|=1,$ then the\r\n\r\nvalue of $\\left|z_{1}+z_{2}+\\ldots \\ldots . z_{n}\\right|-$\r\n\r\n$\\left|\\frac{1}{z_{1}}+\\frac{1}{z_{2}}+\\ldots \\ldots .+\\frac{1}{z_{n}}\\right|$ is,"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "0",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "-1",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "None",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$z_{1} \\bar{z}_{1}=z_{2} \\bar{z}_{2}=\\ldots .=z_{n} \\bar{z}_{n}=1$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\overline{\\mathrm{z}}_{1}=\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{z}_{1}}, \\overline{\\mathrm{z}}_{2}=\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{z}_{2}}, \\overline{\\mathrm{z}}_{3}=\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{z}_{3}}, \\ldots \\ldots, \\overline{\\mathrm{z}}_{\\mathrm{n}}=\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{z}_{\\mathrm{n}}}$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore\\left|z_{1}+z_{2}+\\ldots .+z_{n}\\right|-\\left|\\frac{1}{z_{1}}+\\frac{1}{z_{2}}+\\ldots .+\\frac{1}{z_{n}}\\right|$\r\n\r\n$=\\left|z_{1}+z_{2}+\\ldots+z_{n}\\right|-\\left|\\bar{z}_{1}+\\bar{z}_{2}+\\ldots .+\\bar{z}_{n}\\right|=0$"
  }
}